# Knowledge documents are deliberately NOT committed: they may be large or
# proprietary. MANIFEST.md records what is loaded so the corpus stays auditable.
*
!.gitignore
!MANIFEST.md
!scopes.yaml
# The KB registry is configuration, not corpus: tracking it means a fresh
# checkout reproduces the same knowledge bases, departments and isolation.
!kb-registry.json

# ...but DO track the departmental folder structure, so a fresh checkout
# reproduces the scope layout that scopes.yaml declares. Contents stay ignored.
!*/
!*/.gitkeep
